import sys
sys.dont_write_bytecode=True
import additional_pfp_tests_remaining_audit as a
b='pfp/tests/'
assessments={
'test_discrete_channel_token_witnesses.py':'Full 210 lines. Explicitly calls the scanner a syntax inventory, not proof of approximate admission. Fixed Rust files and selected Python annotated fields are compared by path+code with line numbers ignored; comment shift and one added tol admission provide positive/negative inventory controls. Token authority/source checks are substring assertions, while event dispatch and float packet refusal are intended runtime controls. Rust comment stripping is lexical and not a full Rust parser; Python annotation handling only recognizes Name float and union syntax, not quoted/Optional/aliased annotations. This is a finite selected-source census, not complete dependency or arithmetic audit. No foreign Rust/Python bodies or owner execution.',
'test_integer_slot_decoding.py':'Full 97 lines. Exact ASCII grammar requires3..12 space-separated signed integers; wrong count/types, whitespace, Unicode digits, signs and punctuation refuse. Long integer strings,00/-0 are intentionally retained; shape does not imply zero sum or optimal repair. Injected vLLM runner receives actual grammar and output bytes/token ids, but its honored=True can accompany malformed shape and is independently refused by parsing. Strong explicit distinction between handoff, runner assertion, tokenizer enforcement and mathematics. No sampler/model/provider/native execution.',
'test_local_hf_mechanism_actual.py':'Full 276 lines. Optional real-model tests require explicit local model/revision and skip without them; there is no automatic download in the declared fixture. Nonmodel tests mutate original finite certificates, poison primary Pauli oracle to test a secondary distinction, guard blind capture before expected answers, bind weight bytes to supplied custody manifest, refuse invalid hook selection and missing protocol sources, and recheck raw collation despite forged status. Optional attention/head/residual/logit controls include null and restore, hook cleanup, finite-token language retaining wrong answers, same-seed repetition and short cache mechanics. They measure perturbation/parity on bounded cases, not improved accuracy or C007 long-horizon retention. No env values, weights, moved protocol/case bodies, model loading, downloads or tests executed.',
'test_immune_defect_regressions.py':'Full 190 lines. Exact half-life semigroup batching, invalid-regex typed refusal, Treg threshold at1/5 versus1/6, and exact-type refusal equality are meaningful finite controls. Canonical self-panel is explicitly pinned as1000 entries but40 distinct bases,10 per category. Proofreading tests normalize buzzwords/hyphenation but accept an equation-shaped string; syntactic admission is not proof that its universal zero-sum claim is true. Treg prompt-corpus score is intentionally0/1, not the corpus firing frequency1/10. No panel body, theorem compiler, biological simulation or owner execution.',
'test_local_process_sandbox.py':'Full 204 lines. Windows-only real process controls cover ordinary completion, timeout, output/memory caps and nonzero exit; missing host must not create a marker. Injected subprocess/native failures must not retry a submitted command, enum outcomes/resource values map faithfully, malformed/bool receipts and invalid limits refuse, and typed host refusal is preserved. These tests cover finite process resource behavior, not comprehensive filesystem/network isolation. Memory test would request10^11 list elements if run, so it was kept inert. No processes/native host/imports or destructive effects executed.',
'test_import_purity_and_candidate_identity.py':'Full 52 lines. CandidateArtifactV1 exports must be the same class and survive a simple roundtrip. The separate import-purity test merely imports pfp, checks an initialization callable/export and calls it; it neither observes side effects nor ensures a fresh import (F107). Identity evidence is limited to three export routes and one payload. No module import or explicit port initialization executed by audit.'}
for name,s in assessments.items():a.record(b+name,1,len(a.source(b+name)),s)
n=a.read('_notes.json');ev=lambda name,x,y:{'path':b+name,'sha256':a.row(b+name)['sha256'],'lines':[x,y]}
n['findings'].append({'id':'PFPTESTS-F107','severity':'low','statement':'The named import-purity test does not observe or forbid import side effects.','evidence':[ev('test_import_purity_and_candidate_identity.py',43,52)],'reason':'It imports pfp in the current process, asserts the initializer exists and is exported, then invokes it. No fresh-interpreter boundary or guard on native/network/filesystem work is installed, and earlier suite imports may already cache the module. A side-effectful import can satisfy every assertion.','limits':'This test alone supplies no purity evidence; other fresh-import tests are separate and may be stronger.'})
n['claims'].append({'id':'PFPTESTS-CL039','statement':'Integer-slot and optional local-model tests explicitly separate grammar shape, injected runner testimony, actual token/sampler effects and mathematical judgment; optional tensor tests require a pinned local checkpoint and use null/restore controls.','evidence':[ev('test_integer_slot_decoding.py',49,55),ev('test_integer_slot_decoding.py',58,97),ev('test_local_hf_mechanism_actual.py',22,28),ev('test_local_hf_mechanism_actual.py',174,240),ev('test_local_hf_mechanism_actual.py',264,276)],'limits':'Source review only; optional model tests were not run, and no learning efficacy, external model identity or long-horizon result is established.'})
a.write('_notes.json',n);a.report()
